Speak to me Frank, speak to me.

1734
01:30:08,001 --> 01:30:10,335
- Clay, close your robe.

1735
01:30:11,735 --> 01:30:13,268
- Sorry!

1736
01:30:13,268 --> 01:30:14,535
 - Oh, I just
 thought I'd check in

1737
