you'll be a
profoundly, lonely man.

1748
01:30:41,735 --> 01:30:44,235
- Thank you Frank,
that's very kind of you.

1749
01:30:44,235 --> 01:30:46,635
  - And just let me say
  this to anyone out there,

1750
