 crushed your skull.

1754
01:30:56,968 --> 01:31:01,935
  Always be yourself, and
  wave your freak flag high.

1755
01:31:03,368 --> 01:31:06,601
 - Jeez, it must be horrible
 to work for a boss like that.

1756
